#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — media player (Clips > Media)
 *
 *   Clips gets two tabs: Clips (as before) and Media. Media plays your music and videos from folders
 *   you add or files you open or drop in, with titles, artists and album art. Playlists: make your
 *   own, import .m3u .m3u8 .pls .xspf .wpl files, export .m3u8. YouTube videos and playlists by link.
 *   Files the window can't play (AVI, WMV...) are converted once with AURA's FFmpeg. A mini player
 *   keeps going on every page, and Windows' media keys and volume overlay work.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-media-player-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-media-player-setup.cjs --undo
 */
